x.q('event_envelope_and_lifecycle',0,20,36,'runtime_event_truth','Preserve event/time/type, aggregate type/id and parent when present, causation/correlation, workflow version, work key/run/job/function/materialization/frame-attempt/frame-lineage/vector when present, and closed data. Authoritative coverage includes run/call/frame lifecycle, vector traversal/dispatch, proof/closure, continuation, correction/supersession. Open/close/fail/rebound facts remain authoritative; snapshots/checkpoints only assist. Observe worker process boundaries, not internal chain-of-thought, tactic steps or private decomposition. Emit yielded handoff and causing nonblocking observer facts, never infer handoff from no terminal failure.')
