x.q('actor_failure_and_causal_capture',0,38,44,'actor_process_evidence','Capture invocation start, process start/spawn failure, stdout/stderr chunks, heartbeat/liveness, timeout, signal request, exit, result-artifact observation and closure/failure. Type spawn/unavailable command/path drift/sandbox denial/timeout/signal/nonzero failures; they cannot crash admission, disappear into stderr or be only absent artifacts. Bind run/function/call/frame/vector/invocation/worker/causation/correlation to replay the active boundary.')
x.q('modulation_temporal_event_law',0,46,54,'runtime_event_truth','Admit modulation resolution/envelope/dispatch/progress/non-progress/forced-review/same-edge planning/exhaustion with basis/function/run/work/call/frame/lineage/vector/edge/causation/correlation. Fluent-changing kinds declare Event Calculus initiated/terminated/clipped/declipped effects. Temporal provider truth enters only through admitted intent/outcome/breach/scheduled-continuation events with basis/function/call/frame/vector/edge/policy/provider/causation/correlation; breaches also retain deadline ref/action. Only canonical GraphVector abg.traversal_strategy, GraphFunction abg.default_traversal_strategy and Role.policy_hooks abg.traversal_strategy keys are live strategy authority.')
x.q('one_surface_event_ownership',0,56,56,'runtime_event_truth','Reuse the published construction census: episode binds program/workspace/basis/lineage; observations bind exact snapshot; synthesizeModel/evalGap/evaluateNext/evaluateAction owning invocation/results bind own I/O; catalog records program-projection basis; intent/invocation binds NextActionProjection and ConstructionIntent; evidence/delta binds evaluation inputs. Primary authority requires declared Event Calculus effects. Model/gap/target-binding/priority/next-action/ledger/decision/progress/stagnation/public-terminal/summary are derived read models under RuntimeDerivedFluentRule unless explicitly granted primary authority. No absent event kind is authorized.')
x.q('probe_event_truth',0,58,60,'actor_process_evidence runtime_event_truth','Liveness/watchdog/retry/status-affecting probes or interruption require runtime_activity_probe_observed/runtime_external_interruption_observed with basis/function/run/work/call/frame/vector/edge, optional actor/worker/backend, probe/source, system/runtime-asset, evidence, causation/correlation and elapsed time. Logs, ledgers, manifests, PTY/streams/artifacts/reports/archives/heartbeats/structured streams normalize through this family when liveness evidence. Fluent-changing probes declare effects: activity initiates recent/active; external safety interruption terminates active and initiates interrupted/blocked.')
x.q('durability_and_event_scope',0,62,64,'runtime_event_truth','On installed/public paths configured with replay log, durable append is part of sink acceptance before the next effect observes downstream state; terminal-only flush is insufficient and buffers/transcripts/traces/archives cannot replace log truth. Every kind carries basis and meaningful run/work or is declared run-independent with a named scope class. At least registry publication/function selection/node satisfaction/workspace installation are workspace-scoped, pass basis filters by declaration, and shared-store folds state that scope. Neither scoped nor declared-independent is carrier defect.')
