x.q('ordinal_fail_closed_and_forgery',0,68,72,'admission_ordinal','Reject ordinal collisions and candidate sets not totally ordered at ingest. Ordinal state is per-store emitter context; live contexts reject externally prestamped canonical envelopes as forgery. Replay-tolerant contexts admit prior canonical truth only in ordinal order.')
