x.q('observation_and_ingress_boundaries',0,85,87,'runtime_event_truth','Ordinary re-observation preserves workspace-binding and execution-basis refs; each observation has own snapshot id/digest. Observation/projection/file/replay/worksite change cannot imply binding or basis fork. Public-operation admission attests typed ingress, actor, variant, invocation authority and binding requirement only; model/gap/next-action/action evaluation, ordering, retry, continuation and closure remain admitted GTL/ABG ownership.')
